  description: '2 Level 5 or higher "Gladiator Beast" monsters

    Must first be
    Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by shuffling the above cards you control
    into the Deck. (You do not use "Polymerization".) Cannot be used as Fusion Material.
    Once per turn: You can Special Summon 1 "Gladiator Beast" Fusion Monster from
    your Extra Deck, except "Gladiator Beast Tamer Editor", ignoring its Summoning
    conditions. At the end of the Battle Phase, if your "Gladiator Beast" monster
    battled: You can shuffle that monster into the Deck or Extra Deck; Special Summon
    1 "Gladiator Beast" monster from your Deck.'
